12
• The trick is getting into better businesses since over the long term you will not make a
return much different than what the underlying business earns. Recommends trying to
find great businesses when they're still small - something he might do if he were young
but BRK can't do that
• Management matters but if you have to bet on business momentum or the managers, bet
